    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d302">

                <pb facs="0378" n="280" xml:id="pg280"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum handed to the Secretary of State by the
                        Chinese minister.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Chinese Legation</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-07-20"><hi rendition="#italic">July 20,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Cablegram from the Shanghai Taotai
                        Yu, dated 20th July, received by Minister Wu on same date.</hi></p>
                <p>Your telegram was forwarded as requested. I send you the reply of Tsungli Yamen,
                    as follows: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>Your telegram of the 15th day of this moon (11th July) received.
                            Secretary of State’s telegram has been handed to Minister Conger.
                            Herewith Minister Conger’s reply to the Secretary of State.<anchor n="1"
                                xml:id="d302-f1"/> Please forward.</p>
                    </quote></p>


                <xi:include href="d302-a1.xml" xpointer="d302-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
